  "title": "All Indian seafarers safe as drone-hit tanker reaches Romanian port: Embassy",
  "summary": "A drone-hit Indian chemical tanker carrying nine seafarers reached the Romanian port of Constanta, with all crew members safe, as confirmed by the Indian Embassy. The Indian mission in Bucharest also assured the crew of the Indian government’s full support and assistance.",
